      "Description": "The limited public use data for the ARTnet study of men who have sex with men (MSM) in the United States. The aims of this study are to characterize the sexual network structure and behavior within networks of MSM across the U.S. for use in descriptive epidemiological  research and mathematical modeling studies in this target population.",
